<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in the &quot;Euro</p>
<p>6ix's&quot; six-a-side tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam	     6  Glasgow Rangers	     2</p>
<p>AC Milan		     5  Liverpool		     0</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam	     2  AC Milan			2</p>
<p>Glasgow Rangers	    7  Liverpool		     3</p>
<p>Standings after four games</p>
<p>				   P    W    D    L    F   A    Pts</p>
<p>1.AC Milan		     2    1    1    0    7   2    4</p>
<p>2.Ajax Amsterdam	     2    1    1    0    8   4    4</p>
<p>3.Glasgow Rangers	    2    1    0    1    9   9    3</p>
<p>4.Liverpool		    2    0    0    2    3  12    0</p>
<p>The remaining two games of the first round-robin stage, plus final and third-place play-off take place on Tuesday.</p>
